# Compiler 2 — STA IR generation (Swan/SVM to assembly IR)
# STA means Swan Target Assembly in this compiler architecture.
# Lowers verified, optimized SVM IR into target-specific assembly IR. It is not a
# runtime interpreter and must not execute SVM instructions.
# TODO: define target-neutral lowering interfaces plus target-specific instruction,
# operand, relocation, calling-convention and control-flow representations.
